  "body": "In 205659fe48f3aaf241f071e5ed0078d146812d7f we made all properties on cross-origin objects enumerable, equivalent to their same-origin object counterparts.\r\n\r\nHowever, this turned out not be web-compatible. This makes them unenumerable again with the exception of array index property names, which need to be enumerable.\r\n\r\nTests: ...\r\n\r\nFixes #3183.",
